<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0037/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Fondaparinux\nAnticoagulant\n-\nYes (maximum of 10%)\nYes (excreted in rat milk)\nInadequate human data\n• use only when benefit outweighs risk\nAnimal data:\n• studies in rats/rabbits: subcutaneous doses up to 10 mg/kg/day in rats (about 32 × RHD based on body surface area) and at subcutaneous doses up to 10 mg/kg/day in rabbits (about 65 × RHD based on body surface area) revealed no evidence of impaired fertility or harm to the foetus\n• should not be prescribed to pregnant women unless clearly necessary (see also discussion in section 11)" .
