<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0037/tu_0006/locator> <http://digistrucmed.org/headerPath> "Pregnancy and reproductive evidence" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0037/tu_0002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Furosemide\nDiuretic (loop)\nC\nYes\nWell tolerated; milk production can be reduced\nOligohydramnios\n• inadequate human data\n• use only when benefit outweighs risk\n• monitoring of foetal growth is recommended\nAnimal data:\n• unexplained maternal deaths and abortions in rabbits (2, 4, and 8 × MRHD)\n• increased incidence and severity of hydronephrosis in mice and rabbits" .
